- [Content Domain 1: Design Secure Architectures](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/aws-certification/latest/solutions-architect-associate-03/solutions-architect-associate-03-domain1.md): Tasks
- [Content Domain 2: Design Resilient Architectures](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/aws-certification/latest/solutions-architect-associate-03/solutions-architect-associate-03-domain2.md): Tasks
